# Data is never committed (raw data may be licensed; see docs/DATA_SOURCES.md).
# Exception: the exported, derived prediction bundle the API and dashboard serve - not raw or
# licensed data (see src/models/export_predictions.py), and committed so Streamlit Community
# Cloud has something to serve on a fresh clone (see docs/DECISIONS.md). A "dir/" pattern makes
# git skip the directory entirely, so nested "!" exceptions below it are silently ignored - these
# use "dir/*" wildcards instead, which git still descends into.
data/*
!data/processed/
data/processed/*
!data/processed/served_events.csv
!data/processed/served_predictions.csv

# Python
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# Notebooks and OS
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.DS_Store

# Claude Code instructions and internal working docs: not part of the public deliverable.
docs/
CLAUDE.md
scraper.py
scripts/pull_majors_odds_once.py
scripts/test_against_majors_odds.py

# These test scraper.py, which is not part of the public repo (see above).
tests/test_scraper.py
tests/test_leakage.py
